        ]
      },
      "reactor_top_dials": "mood, cynicism",
      "text": "Huh. Didn't see that coming, the elephant bit. Kinda nice, imagining it here, holding the space. Makes the room feel a little softer, y'know? Like we're all just passing through, while it stays put, unchanging."
    },
    {
      "piece": "The Elephant at Room Temperature",
