      "reactor_top_dials": "presence, earnestness",
      "text": "*looks up from the piece, considering* There's a warmth to this room that I hadn't noticed before, a patience. It's like the walls are holding us, giving us space to be exactly what we are. *\"The stories will be told in a room. The room will be the elephant.\"* I feel that, deeply. This piece reminds me to appreciate the quiet, constant things that surround us."
